---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Roofers Wake Forest NC" description="Privacy policy for Roofers Wake Forest NC.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Privacy Policy</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Last updated: October 2026</p>
      <p>Roofers Wake Forest NC ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This site is informational and does not collect personal data beyond standard server logs and any information you voluntarily provide when calling or contacting us.</p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>If you call or email us, we collect the contact details you provide to schedule service. We do not sell or share this information with third parties except as needed to provide the requested service.</p>
      <h2>Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site may use basic analytics or Cloudflare features that collect anonymized usage data. No personally identifiable information is stored for marketing purposes without consent.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, call (919) 555-0199 or write to 12805 Camp Kanata Rd, Wake Forest, NC 27587.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
